Break-glass report for <%= @report.month.strftime("%B %Y") %>

Requests: <%= @report.requests.size %>
Decryptions: <%= @report.decryptions.size %>
Pre-review image views: <%= @report.pre_review_views %>
Member notices delayed now: <%= @report.delayed_notices.size %>

<% @report.decryptions.each do |decryption| %>
<% record = decryption.break_glass_record %>
- <%= TimeHelper.time_text(decryption.created_at) %>: <%= decryption.viewer&.full_name || "A deleted user" %> decrypted the image for <%= record.public_id %>.
  Reason: <%= record.reason %>
  Notices: <%= decryption.notices.map { |notice| "#{notice.recipient_kind} #{notice.sent? ? 'sent' : (notice.delayed? ? 'delayed' : 'waiting')}" }.join(", ") %>
<% end %>
<% @report.delayed_notices.each do |notice| %>
- Delayed member notice for <%= notice.break_glass_record.public_id %> since <%= TimeHelper.time_text(notice.delayed_at, :date) %>: <%= notice.delay_reason %> (<%= notice.delay_signed_off? ? "signed off, holds until #{TimeHelper.time_text(notice.delay_ends_at, :date)} at the latest" : "not signed off" %>)
<% end %>

Identity team governance: <%= @report.governance_events.size %> steps
<% @report.governance_events.each do |event| %>
- <%= TimeHelper.time_text(event.created_at) %>: <%= event.summary %><%= " Reason: #{event.data['reason']}" if event.data["reason"].present? %>
<% end %>

Changes to privileged attributes (permanent log): <%= @report.privileged_changes.size %>
<% @report.privileged_changes.each do |change| %>
- <%= TimeHelper.time_text(change.changed_at) %>: <%= change.summary %>. By <%= change.actor_name %>.
<% end %>

The identity team now: <%= @report.identity_team.map { |member| [member.full_name, ("key holder" if member.identity_key_holder), ("lead" if member.identity_lead)].compact.join(", ") }.join("; ").presence || "nobody" %>

Full report: <%= @report_url %>
